# Apps folder layout

## SMB-access-service (Tipper-Network/SMB-access-service)

All deployables under **`apps/`**:

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `apps/api` | `@hardport/access` — platform HTTP API |
| `apps/web` | Reserved for future Access-owned Next (placeholder until built) |
| `packages/core` | Shared library vendored in this repo |

**Never** add new top-level `services/access` or duplicate API trees. Docker build uses repo-root `Dockerfile` → `apps/api`.

## The Hard Port monorepo (this repo)

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `apps/web` | Marketing + intake Next site |
| `apps/api` | **Website** Nest intake API — not platform Access |
| `packages/access-ui` | Installable console/widgets npm package |

Platform Access **does not** live in this monorepo. Point env at hosted `HP_ACCESS_URL`.

When adding a new runnable in either repo, default to **`apps/<name>/`**, not `services/<name>/src`.
